id: foundation
name: Foundation (base, focus ring, icons, helpers)
category: foundation
summary: Page skeleton, base reset, focus ring, icon helper, skip link, screen-reader helper and a theme toggle script. Every other component assumes this.
requires:
@@spec
- Load the token sheet first (get_tokens format=css), then this base, then components.
- Root font size is never overridden: 1rem = 16px so rem math matches the dp spec.
- Focus indicator: 3dp ring in the secondary role, 2dp offset, only on :focus-visible.
- Body text defaults to Body Large. Pick the role for each surface with get_type_role.
- Icons are Material Symbols. If the font is a static subset, verify each icon name is in it: a missing name renders as literal ligature text (for example "quiz" shows as "UIZ").
@@a11y
- One <h1> per page, then contiguous heading levels.
- A skip link as the first focusable element.
- Icons are decoration: aria-hidden="true". The control around them carries the name.
- Set lang on <html>.
@@html
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Page title</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="md3-expressive.css">
</head>
<body>
  <a class="md-skip" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
  <main id="main">
    <h1 class="md-type-headline-large">Page title</h1>
    <p class="md-type-body-large">Reading text uses Body Large.</p>
    <button class="md-btn md-btn--tonal" type="button">
      <span class="md-icon" aria-hidden="true">settings</span>
      Settings
    </button>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
@@css
*,
*::before,
*::after { box-sizing: border-box; }

html { -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; }

body {
  margin: 0;
  background: var(--md-background);
  color: var(--md-on-background);
  font-family: var(--md-font-plain);
  font-size: var(--md-type-body-large-size);
  line-height: var(--md-type-body-large-line);
  letter-spacing: var(--md-type-body-large-tracking);
}

:focus-visible {
  outline: 0.1875rem solid var(--md-secondary);
  outline-offset: 0.125rem;
}

.md-sr-only {
  position: absolute;
  width: 0.0625rem;
  height: 0.0625rem;
  margin: -0.0625rem;
  padding: 0;
  overflow: hidden;
  clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0);
  white-space: nowrap;
  border: 0;
}

.md-skip {
  position: absolute;
  top: var(--sp-sm);
  left: var(--sp-sm);
  z-index: 1000;
  padding: var(--sp-md) var(--sp-lg);
  border-radius: var(--shape-full);
  background: var(--md-primary);
  color: var(--md-on-primary);
  font-size: var(--md-type-label-large-size);
  font-weight: var(--md-type-label-large-weight);
  text-decoration: none;
  transform: translateY(-200%);
}

.md-skip:focus-visible { transform: translateY(0); }

.md-icon {
  display: inline-block;
  font-family: "Material Symbols Rounded", "Material Symbols Outlined";
  font-size: 1.5rem;
  font-style: normal;
  font-weight: 400;
  line-height: 1;
  letter-spacing: normal;
  text-transform: none;
  white-space: nowrap;
  direction: ltr;
  user-select: none;
  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  font-variation-settings: "FILL" 0, "wght" 400, "GRAD" 0, "opsz" 24;
}

.md-icon--filled { font-variation-settings: "FILL" 1, "wght" 400, "GRAD" 0, "opsz" 24; }

.md-surface-1 { background: var(--md-surface-1); }
.md-surface-2 { background: var(--md-surface-2); }
.md-surface-3 { background: var(--md-surface-3); }
.md-surface-4 { background: var(--md-surface-4); }
.md-surface-5 { background: var(--md-surface-5); }
@@js
// Optional light/dark toggle. Put a pre-paint copy of the first block in <head> to avoid a flash.
(function () {
  var root = document.documentElement;
  try {
    var saved = localStorage.getItem('theme');
    if (saved === 'light' || saved === 'dark') root.setAttribute('data-theme', saved);
  } catch (e) { /* storage blocked: follow the OS */ }

  document.addEventListener('click', function (ev) {
    var btn = ev.target.closest('[data-md-theme-toggle]');
    if (!btn) return;
    var dark = root.getAttribute('data-theme') === 'dark' ||
      (!root.hasAttribute('data-theme') && matchMedia('(prefers-color-scheme: dark)').matches);
    var next = dark ? 'light' : 'dark';
    root.setAttribute('data-theme', next);
    btn.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(next === 'dark'));
    try { localStorage.setItem('theme', next); } catch (e) { /* ignore */ }
  });
})();
@@notes
Dark mode needs no second stylesheet: the token sheet re-points the color roles under prefers-color-scheme and [data-theme].
